# Play test of Tidefall Reach (CIPlay tidefall_reach, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: down the drowned street into
# the sunken town, its temple's offerings, a house's barrel, the east wreck's barrel past the stingrays; the tribe's camp
# and its chest and barrel, the hot springs, the buried tin. Points as in its recipe.
island Tidefall Reach
offset 0.6696 20.9889
expect animals Screecher 2
expect animals Warthog 2
expect animals Stingray 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
wait 5
where TangaroaFounderStatue
read Stone at the street's head
kill Stingray
walk 0 -12 to 0 -16 to 0 -18 h=1
expect stand 0 -38 h=-8
open Temple offerings
open Barrel in a drowned house
open Barrel by the east wreck
kill Warthog
walk 40 20 to 34 26 to 33.5 29 to 33.5 31.5 h=4.1
open Tribe's chest
open Barrel in the camp
walk -54 12 to -58 14 h=1.5
read Sign at the springs
open Barrel by the springs
kill Screecher
dig
expect animals Stingray 0
expect animals Warthog 0
